    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibeedeayda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea agi damanda ang'eada sugoocheanduumeeda; ak goombaliischi gweanyeew damanagi aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Hamutali was hudeaba Yeremiya ghayi abiita Libna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin ng'asheanda muy aba madeeda gheanyanga NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji ng'asheega sean ghayi sin Yehoyakimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyareas muuchi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda fuga Yerusalemu ea Yuda bwak ea ghahoana saawa madeeda gheanyangaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaheawa Sedekiya sugoocheanda Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahita gweaydeaba shageash bea sugoocheanduumeadaanyi, aba sheedeaba damanamughuush, ea eaweeteaba damanamughuush, bea sheedida ghwahidu Nebukadreesa was sugoocheanda Babeli sea shirikareadaanyi gang'uchi Yerusalemu, ak gwaneaweesiina meadajeega sean ak ghamiinda maheemajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geang'waay mujiini ea ghwahita gweaydeaba damwanagi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Sedekiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeteaba shageash bea sheedeaba ang'wan abeeda gwanda jalooda ng'waan jeeda mujiini, ak ea manda hamita jea ghwaak buuneedeaba ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geasaaw ghamarda mujiini; ak gamng'aw headiga sean bea ng'ucheeda ak gwariteawa jeeda mujiini eawa nea gwasik dooshta mida dageascheeda ghamarda asiyeenya, neekeewa boostaaneeda sugoocheanda, nea fuga Galdayo gwaneaweesa mujiini. Nea abeeda saawa ghwaat naweeda gal Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gaweay shirikareeda Galdayo ghwaat geeshta sugoocheanda, ak ghoang'waay Sedekiya aba moohajeega Yeriko; ak ghwadarda shirikareadaanyi sean ak gwanung'usa heeda niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoang'waay sugoocheanda, ak gweadu ea ghoahiidu heeda sugoocheanda Babeli mida Ribla mida ng'eanyiida Hamati, amang'ata goorgweaksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar sugoocheanda Babeli orjooga Sedekiya aba madeeda gheanyangaaschi, ak ghabwar eara fuga sean hees bea Yuda aba Ribla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwalootu gheanyanga Sedekiya, ak gwarada aba biingu, ak ghwaat sugoocheanda Babeli niny ng'eanyiida Babeli, ak ghwayiin ghealooniga bwak ea ghwahita eaweeda jea ghameawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyarjeawda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu aba sheedeaba muut eaweeteaba damanamughuush bea sheeda was gweaydeaba damashageash bea sugoocheanda siguura Nebukadreesa, was sugoocheanda Babeli gawa Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ahaaghwa gea fur sugoocheanda Babeli ea ghwahita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaghwarda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gheeda sugoocheanda ea gealga sean bea Yerusalemu; giliwas gheeda haw iissa ghang'uda beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea shirikareeda sean bea Galdayo, was gea mideayi sea shirikarajeanda haw bea gea furiischi, ak gwanyarjeaweada ghamarda sean neaweesa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haweewa gea furiischi ak ghwaat fuga mwaatkwa bea ghealooniga barbari muuchi aba jeeda buuneeda sea fuga mwaatkwa siipuusa jeeda mujiini sea fuga heawa ng'asheega ghayi heawa sugoocheanda Babeli, sea fuga mwaatkwa bea gadiyeeda was gearnoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gageanu Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haweewa gea furiischi ghwanung'waada fuga barbari muuchi ghoah fuga jea gwasisin sabiibu nea ghabwar ng'eanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea daranajeega lagheanga oomng'i mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea daranajeega ea basooda oomu mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gwanyarjeaweada fuga Galdayo ea ghoah basanga, ak ghwaat lagheanga oomng'i ea ghoahiita Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat dahuundiga, ea ganakwajeega, ea makaasajeega, ea haragweaka, ea dabita sigwariideawa hideeda, ea dabita sean bea lagheanga oomng'i sigadiydooscheata aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eara gweerajeega manang'i, ea buurjeeka, ea haragweaka, ea dahuundiga, ea haleanjeeda siyiina gheaboonyanga, ea dabita geediga ng'andidi, ea gweerajeega difaayi. Nea haleanjeeda dahaabu ghwaat shirikarajeanda ahaaghwa gea furiischi ea dahaabu gil, ea haleanjeeda sisna lapiya, ea lapiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea daranajeega asiyeenya, ea basoanagi, ea heew damaniyeenya bea lagheanga oomng'i mida uuta basooda, ea gidingeayoojiga gheaboonyanga, ghayi sin Sulemani was sugoocheanda sissa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea lagheanga oomng'i bea haleanjeeni seaniini ea mwoamu eeteen durumanataanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea daranajeega, geawunda daraneeda asagi gaba geatin damasis, nea mughuushnataanyi gaba geatin damaniyeenya, nea baraknataanyi gaba moorin ang'wan, ak ea buruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giliwas darana gwanda uhuuda lagheanga oomng'i, nea geawunda giliwas uhuuda gaba geatin samwagu ea gilimwanang'; ak geeneaweesa uhuuda suulga sisna gheareedanga goomamaanga, nea gaba sean lagheanga oomng'i, nea geeneawsa uhuumba giliwas daraneeda. Ak eara daraneedeaba iyeenya gwasunu, gaba goomamaanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda murdajeega goomamaangaji seedam ea damwalah; nea goomamaangajeega sean ea bughala aba badayda gheareedanga sineaweesa meadajeega sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Yuda geayaat Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu shirikarajeanda haw ahaaghwa gea furiischi ak gageanda Seraya was ashoohoocheanda haw, sea Sefaniya was ashoohoocheandeaba iyeenya sea furiischoodigiga asamwagu bea gidaghuudiin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gageanu aba mujiini siyagi haw ambal fuga ng'ucheeda, sea fih ispwa bea girgweageeda sugoocheanda, sinyasa jeeda mujiini, sea ng'oorshoocheanda shirikarajeanda haw ng'oar fuga mida ng'eanyiida; ea fih laadam bea gea jeeda ng'eanyiida, was gea sinyasa bugusta mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ahaaghwa gea furiischi ak gageanda ak ghwaat heeda sugoocheanda Babeli aba Ribla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.26",
