        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba gweaydeaba diktam ea damanispwa bea giibaleakta Yehoyakini was sugoocheanda Yuda, aba sheedeaba damaniyeenya, eaweeteaba diktam ea muut bea sheeda, gageanu Efil-merodaki was sugoocheanda Babeli, aba gweayda madeeda huweewa sugoocheanda, hean ghabwayda Yehoyakini was sugoocheanda Yuda ak gooruuna ghealooniga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloola ng'asheega miyaasiin ak ghwayiin hoorgeadaanyi iheenga hoorgajeega sugoodiga mideawa aba Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghafwakta Yehoyakini hang'weaka ghealooniga. Ak giliwas askwearja aba jeeda eaweagaaschi iissa gweagiischi galeaga sean aba measeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iissa daghwardaanyi bea galeaga sean ghoadaw sugoocheanda Babeli aba giteena gidagasa aba giliwas eaweecha, ea ghwahita eaweeda jea ghameawa aba gidayang'da eaweagaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
